  Placement: 1
  CardStory: "2Club hates honey.\r\n\r\nThis, he knows full well. She mentioned it
    when they were in basic, and it stuck in 2Spade\u2019s brain. Like many other
    things about 2Club. Why is it so hard to think about her?\r\n\r\nWhy is she here,
    if she burned at the stake?\r\n\r\n2Spade shivers, the world snaps back into
    place. But now there is a **divide** where the lines were muddled, like a shard
    of **broken glass.** It digs into him and forces him to consider. What has he
    been doing? Why is the **thing** in front of her not the person he remembers?\r\n\r\nWait.
    Wait.\r\n\r\n**CAN YOU SEE ME?**"
